{"about_the_game":"In Sky bound Hero, players take on the role of Aeris, a nimble and agile character gifted with the power of flight. Soaring through vibrant, dynamic landscapes, players must navigate vast skies. The objective is to collect as many power capsules as possible within a limited timeframe. Each level has its own set of challenges. With stunning graphics and immersive soundscapes, Skybound Hero offers a thrilling aerial adventure that tests reflexes and strategic planning. Can you help Aeris conquer the skies?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith a relaxed and epic feel - You are free to enjoy the game any way you see fit. The movement can be fast at times but the worlds itself are peaceful. Enjoy this game at your own pace.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3055810?t=1751323582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055810/adc1e4e580dfb86695c0c1556de3592c166884f0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751323582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055810/babd62020f2c2f94f973bbf1242f66af79c210a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751323582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055810/babd62020f2c2f94f973bbf1242f66af79c210a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751323582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"In Sky bound Hero, players take on the role of Aeris, a nimble and agile character gifted with the power of flight. Soaring through vibrant, dynamic landscapes, players must navigate vast skies. The objective is to collect as many power capsules as possible within a limited timeframe. Each level has its own set of challenges. With stunning graphics and immersive soundscapes, Skybound Hero offers a thrilling aerial adventure that tests reflexes and strategic planning. Can you help Aeris conque